# rule.prefer.wickup-touched-prose

wick-up the prose you touch: a ramble in a comment, brief, or doc your change reaches gets condensed on the way through. fix forward, on contact, in scope; a large ramble → flag or follow-up (scouts-honor for prose)
enforcement: ramble left padded in prose your change touched = nitpick; doc-wide rewrite smuggled into an unrelated change = blocker
